{title: Mann Mera}
{artist: Gajendra Verma}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
Saari [Dm]raat aahen bharta,        [C]Pal pal yaadon me marta
[A#]Maane na meri mann [C]mera,        Sooni sooni [Dm]shyam soone savere
[C]Behate haiin aansoo mere,        [A#]Jaane kuch bhi na mann [C]mera
Kabhi [A#]tera tha jo,        [Dm]begaana hai ab woh
[A#]Deewana deewana samjhe [C]na,        [Dm]Kabhi khoya rahe,
kabhi [C]roya phir kare,        [A#]Kabhi tute hue sapne
[C]sanjoya phir kare,        Koi [Dm]mann se uljhe na,
koi [C]mann se jeete na,        Dil [A#]raina aisa kar diye phir
[C]bitaaye beete na,        Re mann [Dm]mera... [C]
Mane na mann [A#]mera... [C],        [Dm] .. [C] .. [A#] .. [C]
[Dm] .. [C] .. [A#] .. [C],        Ragg ragg [Dm]woh samaya mere
[C]Mujhko khudaya mere,        [A#]Usse mila yaa de [C]mitaa
Karoon [Dm]fariyaad pukaroon tujhko,        [C]Yaa to de dilbar mujhko
[A#]Dil ya seene se de [C]hataa,        Muze [A#]sari umar [Dm]satana hai ab wo
[A#]Deewana deewana samjhe [C]naa,        [Dm]Kabhi khoya rahe,
kabhi [C]roya phir kare,        [A#]Kabhi tute hue sapne
[C]sanjoya phir kare,        Koi [Dm]mann se uljhe na,
koi [C]mann se jeete na,        Dil [A#]raina aisa kar diye phir
[C]bitaaye beete na,        Re mann [Dm]mera... [C]
Mane na mann [A#]mera... [C],        [Dm]Aisa bhi kya re [C]dil ka lagana
[A#]Aisi bhi kya re [C]mohabbat,        [Dm]Aankhein milake [C]ye maine jaana
[A#]Rone se milti nahi [C]fursat,        [Dm]Kabhi chup chup rahe,
kabhi [C]zidd pe aa jaye,        Bas [A#]ek tarikaa dhundhe jisse
[C]dil ko paa jaye,        Kabhi [Dm]tujh bin jee loonga,
kabhi [C]mar jaaonga main,        [A#]Tujhse sau baatein karta haaye
[C]dil toh verma mere,        Re mann [Dm]mera... [C]
Mane na mann [A#]mera... [C]
